### ============================================================
### LUNGO API - HTTP Test File (REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client)
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000
### ============================================================

### ── HEALTH ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

###

### ── AUTH ────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Register Passenger
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "08123456789",
  "name": "Test User",
  "role": "PASSENGER"
}

###

### Register Driver
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "08987654321",
  "name": "Test Driver",
  "role": "DRIVER"
}

###

### Login (Request OTP)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "08123456789"
}

###

### Verify OTP → returns accessToken + refreshToken
# Ganti otp dengan nilai yang dikembalikan dari register/login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "08123456789",
  "otp": "123456"
}

###

### Refresh Access Token
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "paste-user-id-here",
  "refreshToken": "paste-refresh-token-here"
}

###

### Logout (butuh Bearer token)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer paste-access-token-here

###

### ── USERS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get User Profile (butuh Bearer token)
GET http://localhost:3000/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer paste-access-token-here

###

### Update User Profile (butuh Bearer token)
PUT http://localhost:3000/users/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer paste-access-token-here

{
  "name": "Nama Baru"
}

###

### Riwayat Perjalanan Penumpang (butuh Bearer token)
GET http://localhost:3000/users/history
Authorization: Bearer paste-access-token-here

###

### ── DRIVERS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get Driver Profile (butuh Bearer token driver)
GET http://localhost:3000/drivers/profile
Authorization: Bearer paste-driver-access-token-here

###

### Update Driver Profile (butuh Bearer token driver)
PUT http://localhost:3000/drivers/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer paste-driver-access-token-here

{
  "vehiclePlate": "B 1234 ABC",
  "vehicleType": "Motor",
  "fcmToken": "fcm-token-device"
}

###

### Toggle Online (butuh Bearer token driver)
POST http://localhost:3000/drivers/toggle-online
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer paste-driver-access-token-here

{
  "isOnline": true,
  "latitude": -6.9175,
  "longitude": 107.6191
}

###

### Upload Dokumen (butuh Bearer token driver)
POST http://localhost:3000/drivers/upload-document
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer paste-driver-access-token-here

{
  "type": "ktp",
  "fileUrl": "https://storage.supabase.co/lungo/ktp/driver-001.jpg"
}

###

### Driver Stats (butuh Bearer token driver)
GET http://localhost:3000/drivers/stats
Authorization: Bearer paste-driver-access-token-here

###

### ── TRACKING ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get Nearby Drivers (Bandung Pusat)
GET http://localhost:3000/tracking/drivers/nearby?lat=-6.9175&lng=107.6191&radius=3

###

### Get Nearby Drivers (Jakarta)
GET http://localhost:3000/tracking/drivers/nearby?lat=-6.2088&lng=106.8456&radius=5

###

### ── BOOKING ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Create Ride (Bandung)
POST http://localhost:3000/booking/rides
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passengerId": "paste-passenger-id-here",
  "originLat": -6.9175,
  "originLng": 107.6191,
  "destinationLat": -6.9200,
  "destinationLng": 107.6300
}

###

### Get Ride Detail
GET http://localhost:3000/booking/rides/paste-ride-id-here

###

### Driver Accept Ride
POST http://localhost:3000/booking/rides/paste-ride-id-here/accept
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "driverId": "paste-driver-user-id-here"
}

###

### Update Status → PICKUP
PATCH http://localhost:3000/booking/rides/paste-ride-id-here/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PICKUP"
}

###

### Update Status → ONGOING
PATCH http://localhost:3000/booking/rides/paste-ride-id-here/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ONGOING"
}

###

### Complete Ride (hitung tarif otomatis)
POST http://localhost:3000/booking/rides/paste-ride-id-here/complete

###

### Cancel Ride
POST http://localhost:3000/booking/rides/paste-ride-id-here/cancel

###

### ── TARIFF ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Info Tarif
GET http://localhost:3000/tariff/info

###

### Hitung Tarif 5 km → Rp 14.000 (minimum)
GET http://localhost:3000/tariff/calculate?distance=5

###

### Hitung Tarif 10 km → Rp 21.000
GET http://localhost:3000/tariff/calculate?distance=10

###

### Hitung Tarif 20 km → Rp 42.000
GET http://localhost:3000/tariff/calculate?distance=20

###
